{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coupling is an abstract style puzzle game where the only thing you can do is move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you can still push objects, look somewhere, and step on switches. All objects interact with each other, and you need to understand and utilize the relationships between them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* If you find the white screen too harsh, other color configurations are available, or you can just customize the colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2-3 hours playtime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 types of related objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abstract style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some secrets spread throughout the levels</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694470?t=1747717376","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694470/e95fcbc490d97393fd6082164be2d0e442b21814/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747717376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694470/2a2ad0b4dd2212564bfdbac3f0d32ecf67801d42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747717376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694470/2a2ad0b4dd2212564bfdbac3f0d32ecf67801d42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747717376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coupling is an abstract style puzzle game where the only thing you can do is move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you can still push objects, look somewhere, and step on switches. All objects interact with each other, and you need to understand and utilize the relationships between them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* If you find the white screen too harsh, other color configurations are available, or you can just customize the colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 2-3 hours playtime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 types of related objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abstract style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some secrets spread throughout the levels</p></li></ul>","developers":["xyz"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694470/04031e0677e230b8c70f00af0418e97c366e5dec/header.jpg?t=1747717376","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Coupling uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133518,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133518/movie480.mp4?t=1747233802","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133